## h i g h l i g h t s
In situ enhancement of fluorescence emission of $\mathrm{RuSiO}_{2}$ was achieved by encapsulating $\mathrm{{Ru(bpy)_{3}}}^{2+}$ with silica. The opening of the FRET is completed by base pairing, which realize the sensitive detection of E2 in serum, showing the practical application prospect of this sensor.
